  notes:
  - afterDay: 1
    from: 
    text: Buy real coffee. Seriously.
  - afterDay: 5
    from: 
    text: The girl across the yard waved. I waved back. With a mug.
  - afterDay: 10
    from: Mira
    text: "Thank you for the coffee! My usual: cinnamon + honey \u2665"
  - afterDay: 20
    from: Mira
    text: Heating's fixed. Thanks for the coffee at midnight.
  - afterDay: 30
    from: 
    text: First snow. Two mugs on the sill.
